        {
          "text": "Elishani iti garagale, maqa AABBO Waaqatini abaare. Jennaani gorjami d'ad'alani lama danqara keesaa gadi bahe, ijoolle suni keesa nama afurtami lama artumati gargari ch'ire hobaase.",
